<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name><![CDATA[Nova Scotia & New Brunswick Road Trip]]></name>
    <description>Road trip loop from Yarmouth via Wolfville, Grand Pre, Parrsboro, Hopewell Rocks NB, Baddeck (Cape Breton), Lunenburg, and Shelburne, back to Yarmouth. 8 days, 7 nights, 1,105 mi, ~19h drive total. As driven July 2025. This is our trip report, not professional guidance. Tides, closures, ferry times, and park rules change, so check them before you go. Trail safety notes: https://backpacksandsnax.com/trail-safety.html More trips like this: https://www.instagram.com/backpacksandsnax</description>
